{
  "script_id": "pythagorean",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.55,
      "size": 40752,
      "text": "欢迎来到勾股定理实验！今天我们要学习几何学中最著名的定理之一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.53,
      "size": 40464,
      "text": "勾股定理揭示了直角三角形三边之间的神奇关系，已有数千年的历史。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.3,
      "size": 36864,
      "text": "在中国古代叫做\"勾三股四弦五\"，在西方叫做毕达哥拉斯定理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "theorem",
      "line_id": "theorem-1",
      "filename": "theorem-theorem-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/theorem-theorem-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.58,
      "size": 41328,
      "text": "勾股定理说：在直角三角形中，两条直角边的平方和等于斜边的平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "theorem",
      "line_id": "theorem-2",
      "filename": "theorem-theorem-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/theorem-theorem-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "用公式表示就是 a² + b² = c²，其中 a 和 b 是直角边，c 是斜边。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "theorem",
      "line_id": "theorem-3",
      "filename": "theorem-theorem-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/theorem-theorem-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.72,
      "size": 27504,
      "text": "斜边是直角三角形中最长的边，它对着直角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "theorem",
      "line_id": "theorem-4",
      "filename": "theorem-theorem-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/theorem-theorem-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "size": 29376,
      "text": "这个定理可以用来求直角三角形中任意一边的长度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "visualization",
      "line_id": "visualization-1",
      "filename": "visualization-visualization-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/visualization-visualization-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.19,
      "size": 34992,
      "text": "图中蓝色的三角形就是直角三角形，直角用小方块标记。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "visualization",
      "line_id": "visualization-2",
      "filename": "visualization-visualization-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/visualization-visualization-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.4,
      "size": 38448,
      "text": "红色正方形的面积是 a²，绿色正方形的面积是 b²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "visualization",
      "line_id": "visualization-3",
      "filename": "visualization-visualization-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/visualization-visualization-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "size": 44928,
      "text": "勾股定理告诉我们，这两个正方形的面积之和等于斜边上正方形的面积 c²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "visualization",
      "line_id": "visualization-4",
      "filename": "visualization-visualization-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/visualization-visualization-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.64,
      "size": 26208,
      "text": "你可以勾选\"显示正方形\"来观察这个面积关系。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "proof-1",
      "filename": "proof-proof-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/proof-proof-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "size": 31968,
      "text": "切换到\"几何证明\"模式，我们用面积法来证明勾股定理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "proof-2",
      "filename": "proof-proof-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/proof-proof-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.53,
      "size": 40464,
      "text": "在直角边上分别构建正方形，边长为 a 的正方形面积是 a²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "proof-3",
      "filename": "proof-proof-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/proof-proof-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.71,
      "size": 43344,
      "text": "边长为 b 的正方形面积是 b²，两者之和是 a² + b²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "proof-4",
      "filename": "proof-proof-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/proof-proof-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.49,
      "size": 55872,
      "text": "在斜边上构建正方形，面积是 c²，通过几何变换可以证明它等于 a² + b²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "proof",
      "line_id": "proof-5",
      "filename": "proof-proof-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/proof-proof-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.76,
      "size": 28224,
      "text": "点击\"播放动画\"可以看到正方形逐渐出现的过程。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "pythagorean-triples",
      "line_id": "pythagorean-triples-1",
      "filename": "pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.65,
      "size": 42480,
      "text": "满足 a² + b² = c² 的正整数组合叫做勾股数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "pythagorean-triples",
      "line_id": "pythagorean-triples-2",
      "filename": "pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.64,
      "size": 58176,
      "text": "最小的勾股数是 3, 4, 5，因为 3² + 4² = 9 + 16 = 25 = 5²。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "pythagorean-triples",
      "line_id": "pythagorean-triples-3",
      "filename": "pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.25,
      "size": 36000,
      "text": "其他常见的勾股数有 5, 12, 13 和 8, 15, 17。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "pythagorean-triples",
      "line_id": "pythagorean-triples-4",
      "filename": "pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.64,
      "size": 42192,
      "text": "勾股数的倍数也是勾股数，比如 6, 8, 10 是 3, 4, 5 的两倍。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "pythagorean-triples",
      "line_id": "pythagorean-triples-5",
      "filename": "pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/pythagorean-triples-pythagorean-triples-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.95,
      "size": 31248,
      "text": "右侧有快速设置按钮，你可以点击查看这些勾股数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-1",
      "filename": "application-application-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/application-application-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.94,
      "size": 30960,
      "text": "切换到\"实际应用\"模式，我们来看一个梯子靠墙的问题。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-2",
      "filename": "application-application-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/application-application-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.45,
      "size": 39168,
      "text": "一个梯子靠在墙上，梯子底部距墙一定距离，求梯子顶端离地高度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-3",
      "filename": "application-application-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/application-application-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.47,
      "size": 39456,
      "text": "这就是一个直角三角形问题，梯子是斜边，墙和地面是两条直角边。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "application",
      "line_id": "application-4",
      "filename": "application-application-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/application-application-4.mp3",
      "duration": 1.54,
      "size": 24624,
      "text": "用勾股定理可以轻松求出任意一边的长度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "parameters",
      "line_id": "parameters-1",
      "filename": "parameters-parameters-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/parameters-parameters-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.77,
      "size": 28368,
      "text": "你可以用右侧的滑块调整直角边 a 和 b 的长度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "parameters",
      "line_id": "parameters-2",
      "filename": "parameters-parameters-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/parameters-parameters-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.52,
      "size": 24336,
      "text": "斜边 c 会自动根据勾股定理计算出来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "parameters",
      "line_id": "parameters-3",
      "filename": "parameters-parameters-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/parameters-parameters-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.31,
      "size": 37008,
      "text": "观察当 a 和 b 变化时，c 如何变化，以及正方形面积的关系。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-1",
      "filename": "summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.26,
      "size": 20160,
      "text": "让我们总结一下今天学到的内容。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-2",
      "filename": "summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.04,
      "size": 48672,
      "text": "勾股定理：直角三角形中，a² + b² = c²，其中 c 是斜边。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-3",
      "filename": "summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.9,
      "size": 30384,
      "text": "这个定理可以用面积法证明，也有很多其他证明方法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-4",
      "filename": "summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-4.mp3",
      "duration": 2.01,
      "size": 32112,
      "text": "勾股定理在测量、建筑、导航等领域有广泛应用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pythagorean",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "summary-5",
      "filename": "summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pythagorean/xiaoxiao/summary-summary-5.mp3",
      "duration": 1.88,
      "size": 30096,
      "text": "希望通过这个实验，你对勾股定理有了更直观的理解！"
    }
  ],
